---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Open Source Licenses & Attribution — Markdy"
  description="Open source licenses, third-party notices, and attribution details for Markdy, MarkdyScript packages, and markdy.com."
  canonicalURL="https://markdy.com/licenses/"
  keywords="Markdy open source license, MIT license, third party licenses, open source attribution, Markdy dependencies"
>
  <div class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Markdy</a>
      <h1>Open Source Licenses</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Markdy License</h2>
        <p>Markdy is free, open-source software created by Hoang Yell. All official packages (<code>@markdy/core</code>, <code>@markdy/renderer-dom</code>, <code>@markdy/astro</code>, <code>@markdy/mdx</code>, <code>@markdy/cli</code>, <code>@markdy/mcp-server</code>, and <code>markdy-vscode</code>) are distributed under the terms of the <strong>MIT License</strong>.</p>
        <div class="license-box">
          <pre><code>MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 Hoang Yell (https://hoangyell.com)

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal
in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights
to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell
copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is
