SOFTWARE.</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Icon & Glyph Notices</h2>
        <p>The Markdy renderer contains an inline, read-only registry of monochrome SVG path data for system diagrams. Selected icon motifs are adapted from the following open-source collections:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong><a href="https://tabler.io/icons" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tabler Icons</a></strong> — Licensed under the <a href="https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons/blob/master/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MIT License</a>.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://simpleicons.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Simple Icons</a></strong> — Dedicated to the public domain under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC0 1.0 Universal</a>.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://devicon.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Devicon</a></strong> — Licensed under the <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/blob/master/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MIT License</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Typography</h2>
        <p>The Markdy website and documentation utilize open-source typefaces:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong><a href="https://rsms.me/inter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inter</a></strong> by Rasmus Andersson — Licensed under the <a href="https://scripts.sil.org/OFL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SIL Open Font License 1.1</a>.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/mono/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JetBrains Mono</a></strong> by JetBrains — Licensed under the <a href="https://scripts.sil.org/OFL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SIL Open Font License 1.1</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Core Libraries & Ecosystem Tools</h2>
        <p>The Markdy studio playground and developer tooling build upon excellent open-source projects:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong><a href="https://microsoft.github.io/monaco-editor/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Monaco Editor</a></strong> (Microsoft) — MIT License</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://shiki.style/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shiki</a></strong> — MIT License</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a></strong> — MIT License</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Model Context Protocol TypeScript SDK</a></strong> (Anthropic) — MIT License</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Policies & Terms</h2>
        <p>For additional details regarding usage guidelines and data practices, please refer to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/HoangYell/markdy-com/blob/main/SECURITY.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Security Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    padding: max(3.5rem, calc(2.5rem + var(--sat))) 1rem 4rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .legal-content {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .license-box {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .license-box pre {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      padding: max(2.5rem, calc(2rem + var(--sat))) 0.75rem 3rem;
    }
    .legal-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
